//@version=6
indicator("UCTPROBE_VW_INPUT_TIME_CONFIRM", overlay = false)

// PROVENANCE: written 2026-11-07 for RULING-0927 r1 (docs/pine/capture-queue-2026-09-27.md).
// NEVER COMPILED ON TRADINGVIEW. What `confirm = true` hands the script.
//
// With `confirm = true` TradingView asks the member to pick the time on the chart when the
// script is added. Refused by name on every lane until this is captured: is the value the
// author's default, the picked time, or does the script not run until one is picked?
//
// ⛔ CAPTURE: AMEX:SPY 1D. Add the study, PICK a bar on the chart (record its date), let it run,
// then capture. C01 is the value in days; C02 the picked bar's own time in days, as a control.

c = input.time(timestamp("18 May 2022 00:00 +0000"), "Pick", confirm = true)
plot(c / 86400000.0, "C01_confirmed_time_DAYS")
plot(time / 86400000.0, "C02_bar_time_DAYS_CONTROL")
